                                "sense_id": "2e3d6fb9-554e-35cc-b8bb-6d25242ccd61",
                                "text": "This ambivalent anality both parodied national and gendered fantasies of “hardness” at the same time that it drew on dynamics of racial and queer mimesis to reinscribe hegemonic (white/ straight) masculinity."
